-2.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Galeria do Laborat\\u00f3rio de F\\u00edsica e Eletricidade\\\"><\\/a><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(6663,1045,'_edit_lock','1778868457:1'),(6664,1120,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(6665,1120,'_elementor_version','3.32.1'),(6666,1120,'_wp_page_template','default'),(6667,1120,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"homehero1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"homehtml1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"fisica-home-hero\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"fisica-home-hero__inner\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"fisica-home-hero__carousel fisica-home-carousel\\\" data-carousel>\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__track\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__slide\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/index.php\\/visita-tecnica-inpe-2026\\/\\\" style=\\\"background-image:url(\'http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/PHOTO-2026-03-18-16-06-52.jpg\');\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__content\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__label\\\">Not&iacute;cia em destaque<\\/span>\\n            <h3>Visita t&eacute;cnica ao Instituto Nacional de Pesquisas Espaciais<\\/h3>\\n            <p>Com professores e estudantes do Instituto de F&iacute;sica da UERJ, a atividade refor&ccedil;ou a integra&ccedil;&atilde;o acad&ecirc;mica, a forma&ccedil;&atilde;o e a aproxima&ccedil;&atilde;o com centros de excel&ecirc;ncia.<\\/p>\\n          <\\/div>\\n        <\\/a>\\n        <a class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__slide\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/index.php\\/novos-equipamentos-laboratorios-mecanica-2026\\/\\\" style=\\\"background-image:url(\'http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/03\\/PHOTO-2026-03-18-16-24-39.jpg\');\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__content\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__label\\\">Infraestrutura<\\/span>\\n            <h3>Novos equipamentos para os laborat&oacute;rios de Mec&acirc;nica<\\/h3>\\n            <p>Os investimentos ampliam as condi&ccedil;&otilde;es de ensino experimental e fortalecem a forma&ccedil;&atilde;o pr&aacute;tica nos cursos atendidos pelo Instituto.<\\/p>\\n          <\\/div>\\n        <\\/a>\\n        <a class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__slide\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/index.php\\/recepcao-dos-estudantes-2026-1\\/\\\" style=\\\"background-image:url(\'http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/04\\/PHOTO-2026-03-18-16-03-28.jpg\');\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__content\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__label\\\">Vida acad&ecirc;mica<\\/span>\\n            <h3>Recep&ccedil;&atilde;o dos Estudantes 2026\\/1 integra calouros, veteranos e comunidade acad&ecirc;mica<\\/h3>\\n            <p>Programa&ccedil;&atilde;o de acolhimento aproximou estudantes, egressos, laborat&oacute;rios e iniciativas de cuidado com a sa&uacute;de mental no in&iacute;cio do per&iacute;odo letivo.<\\/p>\\n          <\\/div>\\n        <\\/a>\\n      <a class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__slide\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/index.php\\/formatura-da-turma-de-2025-2\\/\\\" style=\\\"background-image:url(\'http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-05-at-15.51.44.jpeg\');\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__content\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__label\\\">Vida acad\\u00eamica<\\/span>\\n            <h3>Instituto de F\\u00edsica celebra formatura da turma de 2025\\/2<\\/h3>\\n            <p>Depois de v\\u00e1rios anos, o Instituto de F\\u00edsica da UERJ voltou a realizar uma festa de formatura de Licenciatura e Bacharelado, celebrando a conclus\\u00e3o de 20 estudantes da turma de 2025\\/2.<\\/p>\\n          <\\/div>\\n        <\\/a>\\n        <\\/div>\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__controls\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__button\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" data-carousel-prev aria-label=\\\"Slide anterior\\\">&#10094;<\\/button>\\n        <div class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__dots\\\" data-carousel-dots><\\/div>\\n        <button class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__button\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" data-carousel-next aria-label=\\\"Pr&oacute;ximo slide\\\">&#10095;<\\/button>\\n      <\\/div>\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/div>\\n<\\/section>\\n\\n<script>\\n(() => {\\n  const root = document.querySelector(\'[data-carousel]\');\\n  if (!root || root.dataset.ready === \'true\') {\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  root.dataset.ready = \'true\';\\n\\n  const track = root.querySelector(\'.fisica-home-carousel__track\');\\n  const slides = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll(\'.fisica-home-carousel__slide\'));\\n  const next = root.querySelector(\'[data-carousel-next]\');\\n  const prev = root.querySelector(\'[data-carousel-prev]\');\\n  const dotsWrap = root.querySelector(\'[data-carousel-dots]\');\\n\\n  if (!track || !slides.length || !next || !prev || !dotsWrap) {\\n    return;\\n  }\\n\\n  let index = 0;\\n  let timer = null;\\n\\n  const dots = slides.map((_, i) => {\\n    const dot = document.createElement(\'button\');\\n    dot.type = \'button\';\\n    dot.className = \'fisica-home-carousel__dot\';\\n    dot.setAttribute(\'aria-label\', `Ir para slide ${i + 1}`);\\n    dot.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\\n      goTo(i);\\n      restart();\\n    });\\n    dotsWrap.appendChild(dot);\\n    return dot;\\n  });\\n\\n  function render() {\\n    track.style.transform = `translateX(-${index * 100}%)`;\\n    dots.forEach((dot, dotIndex) => {\\n      dot.classList.toggle(\'is-active\', dotIndex === index);\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function goTo(nextIndex) {\\n    index = (nextIndex + slides.length) % slides.length;\\n    render();\\n  }\\n\\n  function restart() {\\n    window.clearInterval(timer);\\n    timer = window.setInterval(() => goTo(index + 1), 5500);\\n  }\\n\\n  next.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\\n    goTo(index + 1);\\n    restart();\\n  });\\n\\n  prev.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\\n    goTo(index - 1);\\n    restart();\\n  });\\n\\n  render();\\n  restart();\\n})();\\n<\\/script>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"homeevents1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"eventhtml1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"fisica-home-section\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"fisica-home-section__head\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <span class=\\\"fisica-home-section__eyebrow\\\">Eventos e Destaques<\\/span>\\n      <h2>Acontece no instituto<\\/h2>\\n      <!--<p>Um bloco mais organizado para divulgar atividades, imagens e acontecimentos relevantes da comunidade acad\\u00eamica.<\\/p>-->\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"fisica-events-grid\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"fisica-events-card\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-25-at-15.23.48.jpg\\\" style=\\\"background-image:url(\'http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-25-at-15.23.48.jpg\');\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-events-card__content\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"fisica-events-card__tag\\\">Galeria<\\/span>\\n        <h3>Registro visual das atividades mais recentes<\\/h3>\\n        <p>Imagens em destaque para comunicar melhor a vida acad\\u00eamica, os projetos e os eventos do instituto.<\\/p>\\n      <\\/div>\\n    <\\/a>\\n    <a class=\\\"fisica-events-card\\\" href=\\\"h