lementor-element elementor-element-detail_626 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"detail_626\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-html_626 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\\\" data-id=\\\"html_626\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"html.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__hero\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__hero-card\\\"><span class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__eyebrow\\\">Linha de Pesquisa<\\/span><h1 class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__title\\\">Gravita\\u00e7\\u00e3o e Cosmologia<\\/h1><p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__lead\\\">Uma nova apresenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o para comunicar estudos ligados \\u00e0 estrutura do universo, gravita\\u00e7\\u00e3o e cosmologia.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__wrap\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__content\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__panel\\\"><section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__section\\\"><h2>Vis\\u00e3o geral<\\/h2><p>A p\\u00e1gina passa a ter uma abertura mais forte e adequada \\u00e0 import\\u00e2ncia do tema, com melhor hierarquia para conte\\u00fados de pesquisa e divulga\\u00e7\\u00e3o institucional.<\\/p><\\/section><section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__section\\\"><h2>Destaques<\\/h2><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlights\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlight\\\"><strong>Cosmologia<\\/strong><span>Espa\\u00e7o para contextualizar temas e frentes de investiga\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlight\\\"><strong>Comunica\\u00e7\\u00e3o clara<\\/strong><span>Layout pensado para melhorar compreens\\u00e3o e leitura.<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlight\\\"><strong>Proje\\u00e7\\u00e3o institucional<\\/strong><span>Visual mais compat\\u00edvel com a relev\\u00e2ncia acad\\u00eamica da \\u00e1rea.<\\/span><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__section\\\"><h2>Apresenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o<\\/h2><p>Com isso, a \\u00e1rea ganha uma base mais preparada para reunir textos introdut\\u00f3rios, pesquisadores, projetos, eventos e produ\\u00e7\\u00e3o acad\\u00eamica.<\\/p><\\/section><\\/div><\\/div><aside class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-card\\\"><h3>Navega\\u00e7\\u00e3o relacionada<\\/h3><p>A navega\\u00e7\\u00e3o lateral facilita o retorno \\u00e0s p\\u00e1ginas principais e a conex\\u00e3o com outros conte\\u00fados de pesquisa.<\\/p><a class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-link\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/#programas\\\">Voltar para pesquisa<\\/a><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-card\\\"><h3>Observa\\u00e7\\u00e3o<\\/h3><p>Esta p\\u00e1gina recebeu uma estrutura visual mais s\\u00f3lida e j\\u00e1 est\\u00e1 pronta para receber conte\\u00fado institucional definitivo com muito mais qualidade editorial.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/aside><\\/div><\\/section>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\",\"scripts\":[],\"styles\":[]}}'),(7257,564,'_elementor_page_assets','a:1:{s:7:\"scripts\";a:1:{i:0;s:18:\"elementor-frontend\";}}'),(7258,564,'_elementor_css','a:6:{s:4:\"time\";i:1779386275;s:5:\"fonts\";a:0:{}s:5:\"icons\";a:0:{}s:20:\"dynamic_elements_ids\";a:0:{}s:6:\"status\";s:4:\"file\";i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(7259,564,'_elementor_element_cache','{\"timeout\":1779461875,\"value\":{\"content\":\"<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-detail_564 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\\\" data-id=\\\"detail_564\\\" data-element_type=\\\"container\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"elementor-element elementor-element-html_564 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\\\" data-id=\\\"html_564\\\" data-element_type=\\\"widget\\\" data-widget_type=\\\"html.default\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__hero\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__hero-card\\\"><span class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__eyebrow\\\">Linha de Pesquisa<\\/span><h1 class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__title\\\">Aplica\\u00e7\\u00f5es Industriais de Radiois\\u00f3topos<\\/h1><p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__lead\\\">Uma estrutura mais profissional para apresentar aplica\\u00e7\\u00f5es cient\\u00edficas e tecnol\\u00f3gicas voltadas a processos industriais.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__wrap\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__content\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__panel\\\"><section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__section\\\"><h2>Vis\\u00e3o geral<\\/h2><p>A p\\u00e1gina agora introduz o tema de forma institucional, com espa\\u00e7o adequado para destacar pesquisa aplicada, colabora\\u00e7\\u00e3o t\\u00e9cnica e poss\\u00edveis interfaces com o setor produtivo.<\\/p><\\/section><section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__section\\\"><h2>Destaques<\\/h2><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlights\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlight\\\"><strong>Tecnologia aplicada<\\/strong><span>Enfoque em solu\\u00e7\\u00f5es e usos pr\\u00e1ticos da f\\u00edsica no contexto industrial.<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlight\\\"><strong>Integra\\u00e7\\u00e3o t\\u00e9cnica<\\/strong><span>Espa\\u00e7o para apresentar processos, m\\u00e9todos e parcerias.<\\/span><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__highlight\\\"><strong>Comunica\\u00e7\\u00e3o institucional<\\/strong><span>Layout adequado para conte\\u00fado acad\\u00eamico e p\\u00fablico externo.<\\/span><\\/div><\\/div><\\/section><section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__section\\\"><h2>Apresenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o<\\/h2><p>Antes havia apenas um t\\u00edtulo gen\\u00e9rico do Elementor. Agora a p\\u00e1gina oferece um ponto de partida coerente para incorporar textos, resultados, professores, infraestrutura e exemplos de aplica\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/p><\\/section><\\/div><\\/div><aside class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar\\\"><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-card\\\"><h3>Navega\\u00e7\\u00e3o relacionada<\\/h3><p>A nova navega\\u00e7\\u00e3o lateral ajuda o visitante a retornar rapidamente para outras linhas e programas do instituto.<\\/p><a class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-link\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/#programas\\\">Explorar outras \\u00e1reas<\\/a><\\/div><div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-card\\\"><h3>Observa\\u00e7\\u00e3o<\\/h3><p>Esta p\\u00e1gina recebeu uma estrutura visual mais s\\u00f3lida e j\\u00e1 est\\u00e1 pronta para receber conte\\u00fado institucional definitivo com muito mais qualidade editorial.<\\/p><\\/div><\\/aside><\\/div><\\/section>\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\t\",\"scripts\":[],\"styles\":[]}}'),(7260,295,'_elementor_page_assets','a:1:{s:7:\"scripts\";a:1:{i:0;s:18:\"elementor-frontend\";}}'),(7263,1184,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(7264,1184,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(7265,1184,'_elementor_version','3.32.1'),(7266,1184,'_wp_page_template','elementor_header_footer'),(7267,1184,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"fisicadocenteshtmlv2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fisicadocenteshtmlwidgetv2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"fisica-docentes-page\\\" data-docentes-app>\\n  <style>\\n    .fisica-docentes-page {\\n      --fisica-doc-bg: #f5f8fc;\\n      --fisica-doc-card: #ffffff;\\n      --fisica-doc-card-soft: #edf5ff;\\n      --fisica-doc-text: #16324f;\\n      --fisica-doc-text-soft: #557089;\\n      --fisica-doc-primary: #0f4c81;\\n      --fisica-doc-primary-strong: #0b2f4a;\\n      --fisica-doc-accent: #59a8ff;\\n      --fisica-doc-border: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.14);\\n      --fisica-doc-shadow: 0 24px 56px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.12);\\n      --fisica-doc-shadow-soft: 0 14px 30px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.08);\\n      max-width: 1400px;\\n      margin: 0 auto;\\n      padding: 28px 18px 70px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text);\\n      font-family: \\\"Segoe UI\\\", \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, sans-serif;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-page * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero {\\n      position: relative;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      margin-bottom: 26px;\\n      padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);\\n      border-radius: 30px;\\n      background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(89, 168, 255, 0.32), transparent 28%),\\n        linear-gradient(135deg, #0b2f4a 0%, #0f4c81 58%, #1f6fb4 100%);\\n      box-shadow: 0 26px 58px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.22);\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero::after {\\n      content: \\\"\\\";\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: auto -70px -90px auto;\\n      width: 260px;\\n      height: 260px;\\n      border-radius: 50%;\\n      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-eyebrow {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 8px;\\n      padding: 8px 14px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero h1 {\\n      margin: 16px 0 12px;\\n      max-width: 14ch;\\n      font-size: clamp(30px, 4.3vw, 50px);\\n      line-height: 1.02;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero p {\\n      max-width: 74ch;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      line-height: 1.75;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview {\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.8fr) repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\\n      gap: 18px;\\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card {\\n      padding: 22px 22px 20px;\\n      border-radius: 24px;\\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fbff 100%);\\n      border: 1px solid var(--fisica-doc-border);\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow-soft);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card strong {\\n      display: block;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px);\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card span {\\n      display: block;\\n      margin-top: 8px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.6;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead {\\n      background:\\n        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(237, 245, 255, 0.96) 100%);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead h2 {\\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px);\\n      line-height: 1.15;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead p {\\n      margin: 0;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n      line-height: 1.7;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-toolbar {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      gap: 16px;\\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search {\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      min-width: min(100%, 460px);\\n      padding: 14px 18px;\\n      border-radius: 18px;\\n      background: #ffffff;\\n      border: 1px solid var(--fisica-doc-border);\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow-soft);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search span {\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search input {\\n      flex: 1 1 auto;\\n      min-width: 0;\\n      border: 0;\\n      outline: none;\\n      background: transparent;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search input::placeholder {\\n      color: #7b90a4;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-toolbar__info {\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.6;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tabs {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      appearance: none;\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16);\\n      background: #ffffff;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      border-radius: 18px;\\n      padding: 14px 16px;\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.3;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      cursor: pointer;\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow-soft);\\n      transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, background 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab:hover,\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab:focus-visible {\\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\\n      border-color: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.34);\\n      outline: none;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab.is-active {\\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f4c81 0%, #1f6fb4 100%);\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n      border-color: #0f4c81;\\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 34px rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.22);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab__label {\\n      text-align: left;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab__count {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      min-width: 32px;\\n      padding: 4px 9px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab.is-active .fisica-docentes-tab__count {\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel {\\n      display: none;\\n      border: 1px solid var(--fisica-doc-border);\\n      border-radius: 28px;\\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f7fbff 100%);\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow);\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel.is-active {\\n      display: block;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__head {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      align-items: flex-end;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      gap: 18px;\\n      padding: 24px 24px 18px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(89, 168, 255, 0.18), transparent 28%),\\n        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.06), rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.02));\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__eyebrow {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\\n      padding: 7px 12px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__head h2 {\\n      margin: 0;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);\\n      line-height: 1.1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__head p {\\n      margin: 10px 0 0;\\n      max-width: 70ch;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.7;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__meta {\\n      min-width: 150px;\\n      padding: 14px 16px;\\n      border-radius: 18px;\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.12);\\n      text-align: right;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__meta strong {\\n      display: block;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: 30px;\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__meta span {\\n      display: block;\\n      margin-top: 6px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      line-height: 1.5;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table-wrap {\\n      width: 100%;\\n      overflow-x: auto;\\n      padding: 0 0 4px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table {\\n      width: 100%;\\n      min-width: 980px;\\n      border-collapse: separate;\\n      border-spacing: 0;\\n      background: #ffffff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table thead th {\\n      position: sticky;\\n      top: 0;\\n      z-index: 1;\\n      padding: 16px 18px;\\n      background: #eaf3ff;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.14);\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n      text-align: left;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table tbody tr {\\n      transition: background 180ms ease;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) {\\n      background: #f9fcff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table tbody tr:hover {\\n      background: #eef5ff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table td {\\n      padding: 18px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text);\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n      line-height: 1.65;\\n      vertical-align: top;\\n      text-align: left;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table td:first-child {\\n      min-width: 270px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table td:nth-child(2) {\\n      min-width: 390px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table td:nth-child(3) {\\n      min-width: 120px;\\n      white-space: nowrap;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table td:nth-child(4) {\\n      min-width: 140px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table a {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      padding: 10px 14px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      text-decoration: none;\\n      transition: background 180ms ease, color 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-table a:hover,\\n    .fisica-docentes-table a:focus-visible {\\n      background: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\\n      outline: none;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-empty-link {\\n      color: #7a8fa3;\\n      font-size: 13px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-empty {\\n      padding: 18px 24px 24px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.6;\\n    }\\n    @media (max-width: 1100px) {\\n      .fisica-docentes-overview {\\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead {\\n        grid-column: 1 \\/ -1;\\n      }\\n    }\\n    @media (max-width: 767px) {\\n      .fisica-docentes-page {\\n        padding: 18px 12px 42px;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-hero,\\n      .fisica-docentes-overview__card,\\n      .fisica-docentes-panel__head {\\n        border-radius: 22px;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-overview {\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-toolbar {\\n        align-items: stretch;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-search {\\n        min-width: 0;\\n        width: 100%;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-tabs {\\n        display: grid;\\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-tab {\\n        width: 100%;\\n        justify-content: space-between;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-panel__head {\\n        padding: 20px 18px 16px;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-panel__meta {\\n        width: 100%;\\n        text-align: left;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-table,\\n      .fisica-docentes-table thead,\\n      .fisica-docentes-table tbody,\\n      .fisica-docentes-table tr,\\n      .fisica-docentes-table td {\\n        display: block;\\n        min-width: 0;\\n        width: 100%;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-table {\\n        min-width: 0;\\n        background: transparent;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-table thead {\\n        display: none;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-table tbody {\\n        padding: 14px;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-table tbody tr {\\n        margin-bottom: 14px;\\n        border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.12);\\n        border-radius: 18px;\\n        background: #ffffff;\\n        overflow: hidden;\\n        box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.06);\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-table td {\\n        padding: 12px 14px;\\n        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n        font-size: 14px;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-table td:last-child {\\n        border-bottom: 0;\\n      }\\n      .fisica-docentes-table td::before {\\n        content: attr(data-label);\\n        display: block;\\n        margin-bottom: 6px;\\n        color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n        font-size: 11px;\\n        font-weight: 800;\\n        letter-spacing: 0.08em;\\n        text-transform: uppercase;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  <\\/style>\\n\\n  <header class=\\\"fisica-docentes-hero\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"fisica-docentes-eyebrow\\\">Instituto de F\\u00edsica UERJ<\\/span>\\n    <h1>Corpo Docente<\\/h1>\\n    <!--<p>A p\\u00e1gina foi reorganizada para uma leitura mais profissional e atual, mantendo a linguagem visual do site e retomando a rela\\u00e7\\u00e3o anterior de professores por \\u00e1rea.<\\/p>-->\\n  <\\/header>\\n\\n  <